# spec: the 700 writes CNC directly with SETGET [1.5] [step, 1], without authentication; level 3 is step 3, since level and step share the 0-10 scale where 0 cancels most. set_cnc reads [1.5] first, to keep ANC as it was; with ANC on that is the one write.
# source: PR #51 hardware report and NOTES.md, NC 700 section (SETGET [1.5] [step, 0x01] works without authentication; steps 0-10, step 0 most cancelling). Synthetic: the STATUS replies, built to the [1.5] layout [steps, step, flags].
device nc700
call set_cnc 3
send 01 05 01 00
recv 01 05 03 03 0b 00 01
send 01 05 02 02 03 01
recv 01 05 03 03 0b 03 01
result ok
